      "body": "{\"success\":true,\"fieldErrors\":[],\"systemErrors\":[],\"message\":null,\"result\":{\"ACCOUNT_WIDGET\":{\"MF-INT-COA0161\":\"Hall and Level\",\"MF-ACO-H0ZBEY_PAGE_3\":\"asd\",\"MF-INT-COA0160\":\"Please fill in this field.\",\"MF-ACO-H0ZBEY_PAGE_2\":\"asdasdasd\",\"MF-CON-DFLT_R_PAGE_1\":\"Details of account\",\"MF-ACO-H0ZBEY_PAGE_1\":\"sdf\",\"MF-INT-912010\":\"Data supplementation\",\"MF-APC-J5J63P_REFERRER\":\"https://mediapackage.messefrankfurt.com/login?language=EN\",\"MF-INT-EEBACK\":\"Electronic Entry System (for vehicles)\",\"MF-INT-912015\":\"In order for you to be able to use the selected service, we need further information from you.\",\"MF-INT-912018\":\"Previous step\",\"MF-INT-912011\":\"Next step\",\"MF-APP-TESTLOCAL_DOITEXT\":\"this is the doi Mail\",\"MF-INT-912013\":\"Please enter <b>Latin</b> characters in the following fields.\",\"MF-INT-912014\":\"Email\",\"SIN-BUTT-BACK\":\"Back\",\"MF-INT-COA0159\":\"Length (m)\",\"MF-INT-9010OT\":\"When you register a Messe-Login, you can order your tickets as printable versions or digital ones for your smartphone. During your visit, you can access the exhibition grounds quickly and easily. You don't have to spend time in Frankfurt at the ticket counter.\",\"MF-INT-COA0158\":\"Width (m)\",\"MF-INT-COA0157\":\"Please select the stand type\",\"MF-INT-COA0156\":\"Please select the hall and level\",\"MF-APP-000KAP_WELCOMETEXT\":\"#### Hello from KAP Europa ####\",\"MF-INT-COA0155\":\"Stand type\",\"MF-INT-COA0154\":\"Your stand registration request has been submitted to Messe Frankfurt.\",\"MF-INT-COA0153\":\"Back to previous service\",\"MF-INT-COA0152\":\"Email\",\"MF-INT-COA0151\":\"Prepare shop order\",\"MF-INT-COA0172\":\"Please confirm by clicking on the checkbox that you are placing orders in your own name and on your own account. Only with activated checkbox you can submit us your data.\\nThe registered invoice address can be found via the menu \\\"Company data\\\". You can also add another own invoicing account there, if necessary.\",\"MF-INT-COA0171\":\"We will now register you as being authorised to place orders in the Shop for Exhibitor Services. You will receive an email as soon as your stand is available in the shop. Please understand that it may take a few days to prepare this.<br/><br/>\\nYou can authorize later additional persons and companies to place orders in the Shop for Exhibitor Services.\\n\",\"SIN-HEAD-PART\":\"Participation\",\"MF-INT-COA0170\":\"No\",\"MF-APC-SCGI2Y_NAME\":\"Media Package Manager - Messe Frankfurt Middle East\",\"MF-APP-CWTB2025_REGISTRATIONTEXT\":\"Erfassen Sie hier ihre Daten\",\"MF-INT-1PAGER_GENERAL_SUBTITLE\":\"Request Information\",\"MF-INT-901009\":\"Forgot password?\",\"MF-INT-901008\":\"Hide\",\"MF-INT-912005\":\"Please select\",\"MF-ACO-5UMBFP_PAGE_4\":\"Details of account\",\"MF-INT-912001\":\"Your confirmation link has expired.\",\"SIN-BUTT-OVERVIEW\":\"Back to overview\",\"MF-ACO-5UMBFP_PAGE_1\":\"Personal details\",\"MF-ACO-5UMBFP_PAGE_2\":\"Company data\",\"MF-ACO-5UMBFP_PAGE_3\":\"Address\",\"MF-APP-DELMPM_DOITEXT\":\"you have been assigned as delegate in the Media Package Manager (MPM) for $fairEvent ${eventYear}. As a customer of Messe Frankfurt, you gain access to the MPM once you have set up your personal MyAccount.\",\"MF-INT-COA0169\":\"If you would like to place orders for one of the events shown here, simply select the desired event from the list.\",\"MF-INT-COA0168\":\"Please select a company\",\"MF-INT-COA0167\":\"Size (sqm)\",\"MF-INT-COA0166\":\"Stand information\",\"MF-INT-901001\":\"Messe-Login\",\"MF-INT-COA0165\":\"Register new stand\",\"MF-INT-COA0164\":\"Here, you can register new stands for which you would like to place orders. You can also make changes to existing stands.\",\"MF-INT-901003\":\"Your information will be saved in your personal Messe-Login. This gives you access to a wide range of Messe Frankfurt services.\",\"MF-INT-COA0163\":\"This is where you can manage the stands for which you would like to place orders in your own name and on your own account.\",\"MF-APP-PWBZ19_REGISTRATIONTEXT\":\"Bitte erfassen Sie hier Ihre Daten, um mehr über das Büro der Zukunft zu erfahren.\",\"CHANGE_PASSWORD\":\"Reset password\",\"MF-INT-OUTPWBACK\":\"Matchmaking for Paperworld\",\"MF-INT-1PAGER_GENERAL_WELCOME1\":\"I am interested in\",\"MF-INT-1PAGER_GENERAL_WELCOME2\":\"Please send me information for participation as\",\"MF-APC-0SU9S8_NAME\":\"Exhibitor Online Application - Indexport Messe Frankurt S.A.\",\"MF-APC-SWXN4D_NAME\":\"Navigator App - Messe Frankfurt France S.A.S\",\"MF-INT-900003\":\"Password strength\",\"INFOONEPAGE_TITLE\":\"exhibitor kit\",\"MF-INT-900005\":\"<li>Use 8 or more characters</li>\\n<li>Upper and lower case</li>\\n<li>Numbers or special characters</li>\",\"MF-INT-COA0174\":\"Only with activated checkbox you can submit us your data.\",\"MF-INT-900001\":\"The Messe-Login is the central access point to all Messe Frankfurt online services.\",\"MF-INT-COA0173\":\"<strong>Please note that you may only specify the company/companies to which you may place orders in your own name and for your own account.</strong>\",\"MF-INT-COA0071\":\"unconfirmed\",\"MF-CON-PWBZ19_PAGE_1\":\"Persönliche Data\",\"MF-CON-PWBZ19_PAGE_2\":\"Firmendaten\",\"resend\":\"Resend confirmation email\",\"register\":\"Register\",\"MF-APC-SWXN4D_REFERRERNAME\":\"Corporate website\",\"MF-INT-902009\":\"Save\",\"MF-APP-DEMODE_BACKTOTEXT\":\"Demosite Germany\",\"MF-INT-TEWELC\":\"You are registering for the statement of participation (including joint stands)\",\"MF-APP-PWBZ19_DOITEXT\":\"Many thanks for your interest in the \\\"Flexibilität I Flexibility\\\" brochure about the Future Office/ Paperworld 2019. Click here to download.\",\"MF-INT-901030\":\"Consent\",\"MF-CON-CWTB2025_PAGE_2\":\"Marketing Daten\",\"MF-CON-CWTB2025_PAGE_1\":\"Registrierung\",\"MF-APP-IGP000_BACKTOTEXT\":\" Interactive hall plan\",\"MF-APC-A3DWJY_NAME\":\"Navigator App - Automecha